I look outside through the window.
The water in the harbour has a beautiful blue colour.
This harbour is very big.
I see the shore in the distance.
There are large wooden nets on the shore.
They are the famous Chinese fishing nets of Kochi.
They are very beautiful to see.
The boat is now approaching the jetty.
I need to alight at Fort Kochi.
I need to go to a shop there.
I take my bag.
The boat reaches the jetty.
The door opens.
